    "detailed_description": "Spellslinger Towns puts you in a magical sandbox environment merging city-building and deckbuilding. Construct, expand, and optimize your city, making strategic decisions that shape its growth. Use powerful spells from your custom deck to fortify your city, overcome enemies, and forge alliances. Manage resources, set up production lines, and navigate diplomacy to ensure your city thrives. Each playthrough offers new challenges and opportunities, providing endless possibilities to be creative and shape the destiny of your realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/b7869d68684d6edb293798c53e84f794.poster.avif?t=1732745834\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/b7869d68684d6edb293798c53e84f794.webm?t=1732745834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/b7869d68684d6edb293798c53e84f794.mp4?t=1732745834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >City builder meets roguelite</h2>Construct, expand, and optimize your city with precision and flair. From humble beginnings to towering citadels, every decision you make influences the growth and prosperity of your realm. Set up well-oiled production lines, trading agreements, diplomacy, and military bases to reach the different end-goals the game offers. Play the cards you\u2019re dealt and break the sandbox!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/6bd4bdc1012a0b98bf9f6446ce435f81.poster.avif?t=1732745834\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/6bd4bdc1012a0b98bf9f6446ce435f81.webm?t=1732745834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/6bd4bdc1012a0b98bf9f6446ce435f81.mp4?t=1732745834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deckbuilding</h2>Craft your deck of magical cards, each offering potent spells, quests, monsters, and powerful enchantments. Fine-tune your strategy as you explore endless combinations to fortify your city, overcome your enemies, or befriend them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/94da1df431039e9776277c9a6e002af0.poster.avif?t=1732745834\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/94da1df431039e9776277c9a6e002af0.webm?t=1732745834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Start with a deck of handpicked cards.<br></li><li>Draw from your deck and play the cards that ideally fit the current situation.<br></li><li>As the playthrough progresses, you'll be able to add new cards to your deck</li></ul><br>Play crazy combinations with your cards, and try to break the simulation. Control an army of armored huskies? If you have the cards, Spellslinger Towns will let you do it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different</h2>Each run offers new challenges and opportunities. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/0ae0b396d4555c129cb7933aa0b87909.avif?t=1732745834\" width=614 height=322 /></span><br><br>Unlock new complexities and upgrades by reaching an ever-expanding array of objectives to aim for! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/e209ab812050b9755c310460d0ec60d2.poster.avif?t=1732745834\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/e209ab812050b9755c310460d0ec60d2.webm?t=1732745834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/e209ab812050b9755c310460d0ec60d2.mp4?t=1732745834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/ee4c60659141ada61f00aa2ef6ebf0a4.avif?t=1732745834\" width=600 height=165 /></span><br>Spellslinger Towns was made possible by the Flanders Audiovisual Fund (VAF).",
