c.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/e209ab812050b9755c310460d0ec60d2.poster.avif?t=1732745834\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/e209ab812050b9755c310460d0ec60d2.webm?t=1732745834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/e209ab812050b9755c310460d0ec60d2.mp4?t=1732745834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903730/extras/ee4c60659141ada61f00aa2ef6ebf0a4.avif?t=1732745834\" width=600 height=165 /></span><br>Spellslinger Towns was made possible by the Flanders Audiovisual Fund (VAF).",
